  "title": "上台前的药  (Medicine Before Going Onstage)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "crew": "场务"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Bu Xiaogu brings Li Mingji's asthma spray and pills to his dressing room just before showtime and tries to calm his nerves ahead of the live broadcast. Listen to the Mandarin dialogue first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "李铭基先生，您的药找来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "对不起，刚才打扰大家工作了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "我太冒失了，不好意思。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我先出去了，有事您叫我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您身经百战，全球好多华人都是您的超级粉丝。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您今天晚上的表演一定会很精彩。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您别担心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "药这样混着吃，不会有问题吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对身体会不会有伤害？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您要不要我去找医生来看看？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "李铭基先生，您的药找来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Li Mingji, I brought your medicine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "对不起，刚才打扰大家工作了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorry for disturbing everyone's work just now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "我太冒失了，不好意思。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was too careless; excuse me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我先出去了，有事您叫我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I will step outside first; call me if you need anything.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您身经百战，全球好多华人都是您的超级粉丝。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are a seasoned star, and Chinese viewers worldwide are your huge fans.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您今天晚上的表演一定会很精彩。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your performance tonight will definitely be wonderful.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您别担心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please do not worry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "药这样混着吃，不会有问题吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Taking medicine mixed together like this will not cause trouble, will it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对身体会不会有伤害？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could it be harmful to your body?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您要不要我去找医生来看看？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Would you like me to fetch a doctor to check?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
